OL,3,GNEWSAWhat we learned from Sussex Police
OL,4,Ain Hot Seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore can be done to increase the number
OL,7,Fof domestic abuse charges, Sussex
OL,8,FPolice's deputy chief constable has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FPaul Court made the comments during his
OL,12,Fappearance on BBC Radio Sussex's Hot
OL,13,FSeat with presenter Danny Pike.
OL,15,FHe also answered questions on
OL,16,Fshoplifting, anti-social behaviour,
OL,17,Fe-bikes and protests linked to the
OL,18,Fasylum accommodation in Crowborough.
OL,20,FHere are the key takeaways from the
OL,21,Finterview.
